WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.021
Everybody has this drawer. Eleven cables,
four of which go to devices you no longer
own.

00:00:06.021 --> 00:00:11.768
You keep them because throwing away a
cable feels like it will cost you money
later.

00:00:11.768 --> 00:00:17.241
It will not. It costs you the drawer.
Label the three you use with masking tape.

00:00:17.241 --> 00:00:20.730
Bin the rest today. You will not miss a
single one.
